{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise the cutest daughter in all of the land in the ultimate parenting simulation!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Magical Princess</i>, step into the shoes of a single, widowed father as he brings up his only beloved daughter from early childhood all the way to graduation at the magical academy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/extras/05b88fe048c61f05545a6b62313f1c79.poster.avif?t=1772325251\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/extras/05b88fe048c61f05545a6b62313f1c79.webm?t=1772325251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/extras/05b88fe048c61f05545a6b62313f1c79.mp4?t=1772325251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With her whole life ahead of her across a variety of different paths, how she grows up and matures is entirely your responsibility. Steer her towards an upright academic career as an ace student, a life of excitement on the stage as an idol, the way of the mighty warrior who takes up the sword, or even pure villainy as the demon queen. With every choice and decision you make, her future changes dramatically!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/extras/2d0fc2fb393894f1439102ee15b2e574.poster.avif?t=1772325251\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/extras/2d0fc2fb393894f1439102ee15b2e574.webm?t=1772325251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/extras/2d0fc2fb393894f1439102ee15b2e574.mp4?t=1772325251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete freedom to raise your daughter however you see fit. Whether that means letting her attend classes, do part-time jobs, go out on dates, sneak out at night, or even indulge in the occasional thievery and other such &quot;odd&quot; jobs, the choice is yours!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enormous amount of story content  including over 170 date scenes and over 50 endings. Interact with a colorful cast of more than 30 characters brimming with personality as your daughter leads her life at the magical academy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover deep mysteries lurking beneath the surface. On nights when the full moon turns crimson in the strange phenomenon known as the Crimson Moon, monsters strike in a world seemingly chained to its fate. The key to unlocking everything just might rest in the hands of your daughter...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/extras/6a0c00030d61566f9832b7c74bed43af.avif?t=1772325251\" width=1560 height=1317 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A character raising game fit for a princess!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Magical Princess</i> is a character raising game where players get to experience the joys of raising a daughter full of potential, bonding with her the more that she grows. What life has in store for her is up to you as you piece together a story of epic proportions! The only question is: are you ready to be a father?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562120?t=1772325251","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/0ea0166d34b606f3f3ca7f2305370fb6d6bc2720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772325251","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/1ffbf0704551c1585a73d56599f6da08a8e227c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772325251","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/1ffbf0704551c1585a73d56599f6da08a8e227c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772325251","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4109100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Raise the cutest daughter in all of the land in the ultimate parenting simulation!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Magical Princess</i>, step into the shoes of a single, widowed father as he brings up his only beloved daughter from early childhood all the way to graduation at the magical academy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/extras/05b88fe048c61f05545a6b62313f1c79.poster.avif?t=1772325251\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/extras/05b88fe048c61f05545a6b62313f1c79.webm?t=1772325251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/extras/05b88fe048c61f05545a6b62313f1c79.mp4?t=1772325251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With her whole life ahead of her across a variety of different paths, how she grows up and matures is entirely your responsibility. Steer her towards an upright academic career as an ace student, a life of excitement on the stage as an idol, the way of the mighty warrior who takes up the sword, or even pure villainy as the demon queen. With every choice and decision you make, her future changes dramatically!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/extras/2d0fc2fb393894f1439102ee15b2e574.poster.avif?t=1772325251\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/extras/2d0fc2fb393894f1439102ee15b2e574.webm?t=1772325251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/extras/2d0fc2fb393894f1439102ee15b2e574.mp4?t=1772325251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete freedom to raise your daughter however you see fit. Whether that means letting her attend classes, do part-time jobs, go out on dates, sneak out at night, or even indulge in the occasional thievery and other such &quot;odd&quot; jobs, the choice is yours!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enormous amount of story content  including over 170 date scenes and over 50 endings. Interact with a colorful cast of more than 30 characters brimming with personality as your daughter leads her life at the magical academy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover deep mysteries lurking beneath the surface. On nights when the full moon turns crimson in the strange phenomenon known as the Crimson Moon, monsters strike in a world seemingly chained to its fate. The key to unlocking everything just might rest in the hands of your daughter...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/extras/6a0c00030d61566f9832b7c74bed43af.avif?t=1772325251\" width=1560 height=1317 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A character raising game fit for a princess!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Magical Princess</i> is a character raising game where players get to experience the joys of raising a daughter full of potential, bonding with her the more that she grows. What life has in store for her is up to you as you piece together a story of epic proportions! The only question is: are you ready to be a father?</p>","developers":["Neotro Inc.","MAGI Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562120/e8f83bc42faf610b3a435bf8fa360fb91dcc8bc8/header.jpg?t=1772325251","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9MAGI Inc. \u00a9Neotro Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3562120/863536/af208fdb5d11f95b75bd4fa1e3715e25376e90c5/1750860021/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744340899","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3562120/863536/af208fdb5d11f95b75bd4fa1e3715e25376e90